message: "If you use this resource in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "Software Engineer: a structured knowledge library for computer science and software engineering"
abstract: >-
  An open educational resource covering computer science and software
  engineering from beginner to research level, organised around a 15-part,
  64-subject syllabus with a topic-level coverage matrix.
authors:
  - name: "Software Engineer project contributors"
keywords:
  - computer science
  - software engineering
  - education
  - curriculum
